password.description:
This is required. It cannot be skipped or turned off. Everything is locked here at home before it is sent: the video, the backups, and the names, dates and sizes that would say what they are.

The repository is public, so anyone can copy the locked files and try passwords for as long as they like. A long password is the only lock. Use at least 14 characters; a few unrelated words work well. The password is never stored or sent. Only the key made from it stays on this system, and a forgotten password cannot be recovered.

